					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thrliteratelad" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5866069); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5866069&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607201008" alt="ThrLiterateLad" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5866069)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thrliteratelad" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5866069); return false;" >ThrLiterateLad</a></span> <span class="odate time_1579893116 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">24 Jan 2020 19:11</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4478390">
									

<p>I really like this.</p>
<p>In a sea of bulky 5kcon entries, this is a nice breather. I was thrown for a loop in the beginning, thinking it was going to be your standard humanoid anomaly sob story, but that lackluster first impression quickly devolved into intrigue, which in turn became amusement. The comedy of this article works really well. I especially liked how the incident logs reiterated on what is essentially the same joke while changing enough to keep it fresh each time.</p>
<p>Spoily Bits:</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I know this is probably just a one-off, but I really hope we hear more from &quot;the travel agency&quot; in the future. An extradimensional GOI that sends people into odd and anomalous situations is a really fun idea.</p>
<p>My one question is how the guy keeps escaping with such airtight conprocs. If they were changed after the escape attempts then why weren't they changed as soon as they figured out that this guy could teleport?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>All in all, it's a +1 from me.</p>

							</div>

								
